{
  "id": "body-temperature-thermoregulation-hea",
  "name": "Core_Response_Time",
  "description": "Illustrative human thermoregulation model. Source reconciliation 2026-10-20: The unverified journal DOI has been replaced by the publisher record for the named general physiology textbook. No textbook equation, heat-unit convention or parameter mapping was established. Heat_Content=1000 and Thermal_Capacitance=27 imply 37.037 degrees, but heat production and loss units/time conversion are unspecified. The model name Core_Response_Time appears to be a copied variable name; its original label is preserved. No physically unsupported conversion was guessed. Scientific calibration and applicability remain unverified.",
  "stocks": [
